    <string name="onboarding_welcome_eyebrow">WELCOME TO TXT</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">A calmer way into your phone</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">txt keeps apps, notes, your day, and screen-time context one gesture away. Each area explains itself the first time you open it, right on the real page. You can skip any guide.</string>
